\title{The six-cycle numbers}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{For the six-cycle just cited, the diagonal value is #{3} and the
neighbor value is #{1}, so the shape #{a/(2b)} equals #{3/2}.
The retained diagonal #{7/3} and the retained neighbor value
#{1/3} are entries of that same matrix.}
